    "t": "<p>En boll kastas från marken med farten 19 m/s i vinkeln 41° och landar på marken igen.</p>\n<p>Hur långt når bollen?</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 280\" width=\"480\" height=\"280\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Parabolisk kastbana med samma längdskala på båda axlarna\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><title>Parabolisk kastbana med samma längdskala på båda axlarna</title><rect width=\"480\" height=\"280\" fill=\"white\"/><line x1=\"45.000\" y1=\"225.000\" x2=\"445.000\" y2=\"225.000\" stroke=\"#7b8797\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polyline points=\"70.000,225.000 73.450,222.031 76.900,219.122 80.350,216.273 83.800,213.484 87.250,210.755 90.700,208.085 94.150,205.476 97.600,202.927 101.050,200.438 104.500,198.009 107.950,195.639 111.400,193.330 114.850,191.081 118.300,188.892 121.750,186.762 125.200,184.693 128.650,182.684 132.100,180.734 135.550,178.845 139.000,177.015 142.450,175.246 145.900,173.536 149.350,171.887 152.800,170.298 156.250,168.768 159.700,167.298 163.150,165.889 166.600,164.539 170.050,163.250 173.500,162.020 176.950,160.851 180.400,159.741 183.850,158.691 187.300,157.702 190.750,156.772 194.200,155.902 197.650,155.092 201.100,154.343 204.550,153.653 208.000,153.023 211.450,152.453 214.900,151.943 218.350,151.494 221.800,151.104 225.250,150.774 228.700,150.504 232.150,150.294 235.600,150.144 239.050,150.054 242.500,150.024 245.950,150.054 249.400,150.144 252.850,150.294 256.300,150.504 259.750,150.774 263.200,151.104 266.650,151.494 270.100,151.943 273.550,152.453 277.000,153.023 280.450,153.653 283.900,154.343 287.350,155.092 290.800,155.902 294.250,156.772 297.700,157.702 301.150,158.691 304.600,159.741 308.050,160.851 311.500,162.020 314.950,163.250 318.400,164.539 321.850,165.889 325.300,167.298 328.750,168.768 332.200,170.298 335.650,171.887 339.100,173.536 342.550,175.246 346.000,177.015 349.450,178.845 352.900,180.734 356.350,182.684 359.800,184.693 363.250,186.762 366.700,188.892 370.150,191.081 373.600,193.330 377.050,195.639 380.500,198.009 383.950,200.438 387.400,202.927 390.850,205.476 394.300,208.085 397.750,210.755 401.200,213.484 404.650,216.273 408.100,219.122 411.550,222.031 415.000,225.000\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><circle cx=\"70.0\" cy=\"225.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2867a8\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"70.000\" y1=\"225.000\" x2=\"110.528\" y2=\"189.770\" stroke=\"#b54b42\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><polygon points=\"115.28257481336632,185.63645826056955 105.86595247539934,188.52215120059302 111.11442470732341,194.5598278423752\" fill=\"#b54b42\"/><text x=\"145.00\" y=\"185.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#b54b42\" text-anchor=\"middle\">19 m/s</text><text x=\"130.00\" y=\"210.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#223047\" text-anchor=\"middle\">41°</text><text x=\"430.00\" y=\"245.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#7b8797\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x</text><!-- vinkelbåge --><path d=\"M 100.00 225.00 A 30.00 30.00 0 0 0 92.64 205.32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7b8797\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></span>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Start och landning ligger på samma höjd, så kastviddsformeln kan användas direkt.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[R=\\frac{v_0^2\\sin(2\\theta)}{g}\\]\\[R=\\frac{19^2\\sin(2\\cdot41^\\circ)}{9{,}82}=36{,}4\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Bollen når ungefär \\(36\\ \\mathrm m\\).</p><p class=\"facit-not\">Som kontroll kan man först beräkna flygtiden och därefter använda \\(R=v_{0x}T\\).</p></div>",
    "familj": "Kastparabler: horisontellt och snett kast",
