"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">+3,0 cm</text><circle cx=\"86\" cy=\"64\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"114\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3.5\"/><text x=\"86\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2B2527\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">t = ?</text></g></svg></span>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">När svängningen startar i det högra vändläget kan läget skrivas med cosinus.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[x(t)=A\\cos(\\omega t),\\qquad \\omega=\\frac{2\\pi}{T}\\]</div><p>Sätt \\(x=3{,}0\\ \\mathrm{cm}\\) och \\(A=6{,}0\\ \\mathrm{cm}\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\cos(\\omega t)=\\frac{x}{A}=\\frac{3{,}0}{6{,}0}=0{,}50\\]\\[\\omega t=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\]\\[t=\\frac{\\pi/3}{2\\pi/T}=\\frac{T}{6}=\\frac{0{,}80}{6}=0{,}133\\ \\mathrm s\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Första passagen sker efter ungefär \\(0{,}13\\ \\mathrm s\\).</p></div>",
