"370\" cy=\"200\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#2867a8\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"80\" r=\"11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"80\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#2867a8\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"140\" r=\"11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"140\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#2867a8\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"200\" r=\"11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"200\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#2867a8\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"110\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff5e9\" stroke=\"#aa4d23\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"220.00\" y=\"117.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#aa4d23\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text><line x1=\"220.000\" y1=\"90.000\" x2=\"220.000\" y2=\"62.300\" stroke=\"#b54b42\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><polygon points=\"220,56 216.0,65.0 224.0,65.0\" fill=\"#b54b42\"/><text x=\"220.00\" y=\"44.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#b54b42\" text-anchor=\"middle\">v</text></svg></span><p>Åt vilket håll böjs partikeln först?</p><p><strong>A</strong> höger, <strong>B</strong> vänster, <strong>C</strong> uppåt, <strong>D</strong> nedåt, <strong>E</strong> in i pappret, <strong>F</strong> ut ur pappret.</p>",
