    "t": "<p>En positivt laddad partikel rör sig ut ur pappret i ett magnetfält åt höger.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 280\" width=\"480\" height=\"280\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Magnetfält, partikel och hastighet\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><title>Magnetfält, partikel och hastighet</title><rect width=\"480\" height=\"280\" fill=\"white\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"430\" height=\"230\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#d9e2eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"49.00\" y=\"54.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#2867a8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B</text><line x1=\"50.000\" y1=\"70.000\" x2=\"418.700\" y2=\"70.000\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"425,70 416.0,66.0 416.0,74.0\" fill=\"#2867a8\"/><line x1=\"50.000\" y1=\"155.000\" x2=\"418.700\" y2=\"155.000\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"425,155 416.0,151.0 416.0,159.0\" fill=\"#2867a8\"/><line x1=\"50.000\" y1=\"225.000\" x2=\"418.700\" y2=\"225.000\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"425,225 416.0,221.0 416.0,229.0\" fill=\"#2867a8\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"110\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff5e9\" stroke=\"#aa4d23\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"220.00\" y=\"117.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#aa4d23\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"180\" r=\"15\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#b54b42\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"180\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#2867a8\" stroke=\"#2867a8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"180.00\" y=\"186.00\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#b54b42\" text-anchor=\"middle\">v</text></svg></span><p>Åt vilket håll verkar kraften?</p><p><strong>A</strong> höger, <strong>B</strong> vänster, <strong>C</strong> uppåt, <strong>D</strong> nedåt, <strong>E</strong> in i pappret, <strong>F</strong> ut ur pappret.</p>",
